nodecode-mixer is a rewrite of Sahil-SS9's Sahil-SS9/hermes-agent-mixer:

  https://github.com/Sahil-SS9/hermes-agent-mixer
  commit f1da4ced08326cac33ba7a9fd0d5c1b6acd19f35

